%% Phase2 / post / G-04a 离线同步撤回
%% Helix owners: sync/flow.rs; acl/sync_effects.rs; event/post.rs
%% 当前生产事件以 im:sync:recovered 为准；旧测试中的 im:sync:state 属于 contract drift。
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS/sync
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC reconnect/sync
    UI->>Gate: im_sync_channels / recovery trigger
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_sync_channels", cursors)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI recovery
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_sync_channels", cursors)
  else Web recovery
    Web->>E: invoke("im_sync_channels", cursors)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET incremental sync(cursor)
  Host->>Go: HTTP sync request
  Go-->>Host: sync page containing type=3 revoke authority
  Host->>E: PortReply(sync page)
  E->>IM: parse sync reply and preserve corr_key
  IM->>IM: ignore already applied event_seq；queue missing sequence
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message.revoke + channel cursor)
  Host->>DB: 同一事务提交撤回与 cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  E->>IM: finalize sync mutation
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message/channel_member
  Host->>DB: readback offline receiver absolute state
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:revoke
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:sync:recovered
  Sink-->>UI: Native bus → recalled message + recovery complete
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw revoke/recovered bytes
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw revoke/recovered bytes
  alt duplicate replay / cursor already ahead
    IM-->>Sink: no duplicate post revoke
  else PersistErr / gap unresolved
    IM-->>Sink: no terminal success；retain recovery pending
  end
  Note over UI,Web: sender 已在线处理的事实不会被离线重放再次发布；sync cursor 不先于 message durable commit。
